>
  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <p>
    Jackie is a Hong Kong–based creative producer specializing in advertising music and brand
    communication. With over 20 years of experience, he has worked with leading global brands
    and government organizations, creating impactful brand experiences through music and
    storytelling.
  </p>

  <h2>Career</h2>
  <p>
    Jackie graduated from the School of Creative Media at City University of Hong Kong with a
    major in Fine Arts. He has collaborated with major brands such as:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>HSBC / Standard Chartered</li>
    <li>AIA / FWD</li>
    <li>Cathay Pacific / Hong Kong Express</li>
    <li>The Peninsula Hotel / Nina Hotel</li>
    <li>Coca-Cola / Pocari Sweat</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    In 2013, he founded <strong>Redline Production Limited</strong>, producing over 200 TV
    commercials with a team of around 10 members in collaboration with 4As agencies.
  </p>

  <h2>Music &amp; Creative Achievements</h2>
  <p>
    Jackie has worked with prominent artists in Hong Kong and Taiwan. His productions have
    received multiple awards and achieved high viewership across music platforms.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>2024 — <strong>Bronze Award</strong> at the London International Awards (Music Adaptation category)</li>
    <li>2024 — Nominated at the Wave Music Awards for Best Arrangement &amp; Producer</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Current Focus</h2>
  <p>
    Since 2025, Jackie has been working as a digital nomad based in Hong Kong and Tokyo.
    He is expanding his creative work into:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Events</li>
    <li>Cultural projects</li>
    <li>Art exhibitions</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Bringing a cross-disciplinary creative perspective grounded in music and advertising.</p>

  <h2>Value</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Brand expression through music and storytelling</li>
    <li>High-level creative direction in advertising production</li>
    <li>International brand communication design</li>
    <li>End-to-end production leadership</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Message</h2>
  <blockquote>
    <p>Music and expression connect people, brands, and cultures.</p>
    <p>Through that power, we create new value for every project.</p>
  </blockquote>
</PartnerLayout>
